			<item>
				<title>Minecraft</title>
				<link>https://mlemrecords.com/about/minecraft/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://mlemrecords.com/about/minecraft/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Mlem runs a small Minecraft Java Edition survival server. This server is open to all, that includes you! You&amp;rsquo;re totally free to drop in and do a little gaming. Do send an email to &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:support@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;support@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt; to get whitelisted.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Please join at the following address:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;minecraft.mlemrecords.com:25565&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Latest Version&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Max 100 players&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;history&#34;&gt;History&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;2026&#34;&gt;2026&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;March 29th&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;So Back&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;2026-03-29.png&#34; alt=&#34;So Back&#34;&gt;&#xA;Gang got over it and locked in. Spawn is recovering, Life blooms yet again.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Contact</title>
				<link>https://mlemrecords.com/about/contact/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://mlemrecords.com/about/contact/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Got a question? Wanna talk to a person? Want to release something?&lt;br&gt;&#xA;You can reach us anytime for the following:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A quick chat - &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:hi@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;hi@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;General inquiries - &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:aliens@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;aliens@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Support - &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:support@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;support@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;DJ ZITwerK - &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:puk@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;puk@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;demos&#34;&gt;Demos&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;re interested in releasing music and you&amp;rsquo;re a cool person, we&amp;rsquo;d love to help out! If you send us files, please send publicly accessible links that we can stream from and a short message about you and your intentions.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Legal</title>
				<link>https://mlemrecords.com/about/legal/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://mlemrecords.com/about/legal/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Mlem Records is registered at the &amp;ldquo;Kamer van Koophandel&amp;rdquo; as a sole proprietorship located in the Netherlands under registry number 87588277.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Use of this site is subject to &lt;a href=&#34;https://mlemrecords.com/privacy/&#34;&gt;this privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;. This site does not serve cookies, make use of AI or blockchain technology. All content served is a result of loving human effort ♥.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;licensing&#34;&gt;Licensing&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Most Mlem releases are licensed under &lt;a href=&#34;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/&#34;&gt;CC BY-NC&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/&#34;&gt;CC BY-NC-SA&lt;/a&gt;. In short, that means you can freely download, share and remix Mlem releases. But can&amp;rsquo;t use them in commercial works by default. Just ask, we&amp;rsquo;re nice! (●&amp;rsquo;◡&amp;rsquo;●)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
